==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|dach}}, from {{inh|de|goh|dah}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*þak}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*þaką}}; compare {{cog|nds-de|Dack}}, {{cog|nl|dak}}, {{cog|en|thack}}, {{m|en|thatch}}, {{cog|da|tag}}. Ultimately from {{der|de|ine-pro|*teg-}}, and akin to {{cog|la|toga||garment}} and {{cog|grc|στέγος||roof}}.

